OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice 'missed opportunities'
OL,4,Abefore woman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt an inquest at Ampthill Coroner's
OL,7,FCourt, Det Supt David Skarratts of
OL,8,FBedfordshire Police was asked if "too
OL,9,Fmuch responsibility" had been placed on
OL,10,FAlbone "to protect herself and to
OL,11,Fengage with police".
OL,13,FHe said: "With hindsight, potentially
OL,14,Fyes. We have an obligation to safeguard
OL,15,Fvictims; it is clearly not for the
OL,16,Fvictim to safeguard themselves."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
